<title>JAPAN: JGBs end up but off highs after 10-year auction.</title>
<headline>JGBs end up but off highs after 10-year auction.</headline>
<text>
<p>*Japanese government bond futures gave up most gains by the close on long liquidation, after testing highs in early afternoon on expectations of a good auction. *2.7 percent 10-year JGB auction produced a lowest price of 100.50.</p>
</text>
